{"title":"아폴론의 심장 [19세 완전판]","thumbnail":"https://dn-img-page.kakao.com/download/resource?kid=6MLDm/hAd4v5wpzA/9RIuxHkXuCE8ylKUWjalh0&filename=th3","synopsis":"<4년 전. 죽은 줄 알았고, 그랬다고 믿었던 여자가 눈앞에 나타났다.>서태준의 약혼식의 날. 약혼하던 호텔에서 태준은 죽은 줄 알았던 여자 진혜연과 마주치게 된다. 미치도록 사랑했던 여자의 죽음에 얽힌 사실을 다시 파헤치는 태준.서서히 밝혀지는 진혜연의 진짜 정체와 추악한 사건의 진실들 속에 태준은 자신의 심장과도 같은 연인을 되찾을 수 있을까.","topComments":[],"commentKeywords":[],"rankSeries":{"daily":[{"date":"2026-08-09","rank":300,"change":{"type":"down","amount":22}},{"date":"2026-08-10","rank":285,"change":{"type":"up","amount":15}},{"date":"2026-08-11","rank":294,"change":{"type":"down","amount":9}},{"date":"2026-08-18","rank":280,"change":{"type":"new","amount":null}},{"date":"2026-08-19","rank":270,"change":{"type":"up","amount":10}},{"date":"2026-08-20","rank":289,"change":{"type":"down","amount":19}},{"date":"2026-08-21","rank":293,"change":{"type":"down","amount":4}},{"date":"2026-08-22","rank":291,"change":{"type":"up","amount":2}},{"date":"2026-08-29","rank":276,"change":{"type":"new","amount":null}},{"date":"2026-08-31","rank":287,"change":{"type":"new","amount":null}},{"date":"2026-09-02","rank":287,"change":{"type":"new","amount":null}},{"date":"2026-09-03","rank":280,"change":{"type":"up","amount":7}},{"date":"2026-09-06","rank":256,"change":{"type":"new","amount":null}},{"date":"2026-09-07","rank":275,"change":{"type":"down","amount":19}},{"date":"2026-10-02","rank":291,"change":{"type":"new","amount":null}}],"weekly":[],"monthly":[]},"viewSeries":[],"metricsSeries":[{"date":"2026-10-07","v":6112820,"rc":12406,"rs":122277,"cc":1882},{"date":"2026-10-08","v":6113002,"rc":12407,"rs":122287,"cc":1882},{"date":"2026-10-09","v":6113159,"rc":12408,"rs":122297,"cc":1882},{"date":"2026-10-10","v":6113313,"rc":12409,"rs":122307,"cc":1882}]}